  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"An Atlas of Radical Cartography is a collection of 10 maps and 10 essays about social issues from globalization to garbage; surveillance to extraordinary rendition; statelessness to visibility; deportation to migration. The map is inherently political-- and the contributions to this book wear their politics on their sleeves." -- Journal of Aesthetics and Protest Press web site (viewed 3 Jun. 2008).</subfield>
  </datafield>
